            "description": "# Taylored Tiles\n[![Test Coverage](https://img.shields.io/badge/Test%20Coverage-100%25-success)](https://github.com/jacob-h-barrow/Penguin-Services)\n[![Security](https://img.shields.io/badge/Secure-True-informational)](https://github.com/jacob-h-barrow/Penguin-Services)\n[![Platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-Ubuntu%2020%2B-critical)](https://github.com/jacob-h-barrow/Penguin-Services)\n[![Python Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.8%2B-critical)](https://github.com/jacob-h-barrow/Penguin-Services)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-lightgrey)](https://github.com/jacob-h-barrow/Penguin-Services/blob/main/Penguin-Services.png)\n\n![tayloredtiles](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/124107313/217258535-05bfe1d9-c3b8-47ec-88c5-53dfd5078e22.png)\n\n- Created By Jacob H Barrow\n\n# In Development\n## Information\n- Built the logic and have a working tkinter interface\n- Need to debug for errors (only spent about 4 hours on it!)\n- Need to implement extensions\n\n## What is Taylored Tiles\n- It's a spin-off from popular games that works with Taylor Sequences instead of words\n\n## Why this game?\n- Some people are visual learners, some need to get hands one, others are purely mathematical\n\n## Who is this for?\n- The people that develop our software, deploy our architectures, and monitor our networks\n- Mainly for people whose first languages are not human, but instead, computer-based\n- Who doesn't speak a human language??? Dumbledore's Army!!!\n\n## Usage\n``` python\n>>> from TayloredTiles import TayloredTiles\n>>> root = tk.Tk()\n>>> tiles = TayloredTiles(root)\n>>> tiles.set_grid()\n>>> root.mainloop()\n```\n\n### Shout Out\n- To my friends at the NSA: even though they undervalue us, we will still thrive!!\n- Just imagine if we weren't burdened with corruption\n- Long live the enterprise: spock out!\n\n\n",
